{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_40_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_40","textTraditional":"一、十有一年，春，王正月。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_40_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_40","textTraditional":"二、夏，五月，戊寅，公敗宋師於鄑。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_40_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_40","textTraditional":"內事不言戰，舉其大者。其日，成敗之也，宋萬之獲也。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_40_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_40","textTraditional":"三、秋，宋大水。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_40_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_40","textTraditional":"外災不書，此何以書？王者之後也。高下有水災曰大水。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_40_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_40","textTraditional":"四、冬，王姬歸於齊。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_40_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_40","textTraditional":"其志，過我也。","sentenceOrder":7}],"overrides":{}}